<body>
    <div class="info">
        <section>
            <h2 class="container">Shipping Policy</h2>
    
            <h5>SHIPPING AND DELIVERY</h5>
    
            <p>● All orders will be processed and dispatched within 1-3 business days (Mon-Fri).</p>
            <p>● Tracking details will be emailed once your order ships.</p>
            <p>● You will receive another notification when your order has shipped.</p>
            <p>● Expect delivery within 2-6 days, depending on your location.</p>
    
    
            <h5>UNDELIVERED ITEMS</h5>
    
            <p>● If your order is undelivered due to incorrect details or missed deliveries, it will be returned to our facility.</p>
            <p>● We’ll notify you once received, and pre-paid orders can be either re-shipped or credited to your account. Store credits are valid for 50 days.</p>
    
    
            <h5>CANCELLATION POLICY</h5>
    
            <p>● Once an order is placed, cancellation is not possible. For queries, contact us via:</p>
            <p>○ Email: <a href="mailto:support@extraalayer.com">support@extraalayer.com</a></p>
            <p>○ Phone: <a href="+91 7020426569 ">+91 7020426569 </a>(12:00 PM to 8:00 PM)</p>
            <p>○ Instagram:<a href=" @extraalayer "> @extraalayer </a></p>
    
    
            <h5>RETURNS & EXCHANGES</h5>
    
            <p>● We do not offer returns as all sales are final.</p>
            <p>● Exchanges are allowed within 24-48 hours of delivery and only for size issues.</p>
            <p>● Products must pass a quality check; if the item is used, damaged, or missing tags, the exchange will be denied.</p>
            <p>● If the desired size is unavailable, we’ll offer a store credit or exchange, valid for 50 days.</p>
            <p>● Exchange shipping takes 7-9 days after the original product is received.</p>
            <p>● If your location is not serviceable for reverse pickup, you’ll need to arrange shipping through a local courier, free of additional charges.</p>
            <p>● Sale items cannot be exchanged.</p>
    
    
            <h5>DAMAGED ITEMS</h5>
            <p>● If you receive a damaged product, we’re happy to assist!</p>
            <p>● Please send a picture to us via Instagram DM @extraalayer within 2 days of delivery.</p>
    
            <p>For any further questions, feel free to reach out at <a href="mailto:support@extraalayer.com">support@extraalayer.com</a></p>
    
    
    
        </section>
    </div>    
<script src="/js/policy.js"></script>    
